4. Loan Terms
(a) Loan Purpose. The Lender shall make a loan to the Borrower in the principal amount of One Million United States Dollars (US$1,000,000) (the "Loan Amount") for the purpose of capital expenditure for the acquisition of machinery and equipment.

(b) Interest Rate. The Loan shall bear interest at the rate of twelve percent (12%) per annum, calculated on the basis of a 360-day year, and payable quarterly in arrears.

(c) Repayment Schedule. The Borrower shall make quarterly repayments of the Loan Amount, together with interest thereon, over a period of five (5) years, commencing on the date that is three (3) months following the Agreement Date.

